course: dictionary
lesson: 8642
title: Seagrass is a plant, not seaweed
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Seagrass is a plant that grows underwater in shallow seas. Its name has «grass» in it, but it grows on the sea floor, not in a field. It has roots, leaves and flowers, just like plants on land.
explain: Read the words around it to find its meaning. «Grown-up green sea turtles mostly eat seagrass and seaweed.» Turtles eat it, and it grows in the sea, so seagrass must be a plant that lives underwater. Ask: what word would fit here? Then try your meaning in the sentence instead of the hard word and see if it still makes sense.
explain: Later, «protect the seagrass» tells you the plant needs looking after. A «seagrass meadow» is a green field of plants on the sea floor, where many sea animals live. Seaweed is different: it has no roots, leaves or flowers.
fact: Seagrass is a flowering plant that grows underwater in shallow seas.
fact: A seagrass meadow is a green field of seagrass on the sea floor.
fact: Seagrass has roots, leaves and flowers; seaweed does not.
fact: Seagrass is a home and food for animals such as dugongs, manatees, turtles, seahorses and baby fish.
fact: «Seagrass» can also mean a strong grass-like material used to weave mats and baskets.
exercise: «Grown-up green sea turtles mostly eat seagrass and seaweed.» What is seagrass? | A kind of seaweed with no roots | *A plant that grows underwater in shallow seas | A type of sea animal | A sandy beach
exercise: «The seagrass meadow was full of fish and seahorses.» What is a seagrass meadow? | A boat race across the waves | A sandy beach where people sunbathe | A kind of bird that lives on land | *A green field of seagrass on the sea floor
exercise: Which fact shows that seagrass is different from seaweed? | It is used to make soup | It floats on top of the sea | *It has roots, leaves and flowers | It is green and wet
test: The phrase «protect the seagrass» means | It means let the sea dry it out | It means cut it down to make mats | *It means look after the plants that are home to sea animals | It means put it on a plate
test: Besides being a plant, seagrass can be used to | *weave mats and baskets | make cakes and bread | build houses from bricks | make the sea warmer
exam: Name two things grown-up green sea turtles mostly eat, according to «Grown-up green sea turtles mostly eat seagrass and seaweed.» | *Seagrass and seaweed | Fish and sand | Crabs and shells | Bread and cheese
